<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.14 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.14 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg Statistics Office released the following data on inflation -</p>
<p>    LUXEMBOURG CONSUMER PRICES *  June	 May	 June 1996</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1996)	 101.07     100.99	 n/a</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (in pct)	 0.08	 0.12	 n/a</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (in pct)	   1.14	 1.07	 n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - * index as measured on the first of the month.  </p>
<p>Statec said month-on-month price rises were mainly seen for foodstuffs, alcoholic drinks and tobacco, hotel, cafe and restaurant bills. For leisure and communication lower prices were recorded.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
